.TH "DRACUT\-MOUNT.SERVICE" "8" "2026-05-13" "dracut" "dracut"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.nh
.ad l
.de URL
\fI\\$2\fP <\\$1>\\$3
..
.als MTO URL
.if \n[.g] \{\
.  mso www.tmac
.  am URL
.    ad l
.  .
.  am MTO
.    ad l
.  .
.  LINKSTYLE blue R < >
.\}
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dracut-mount.service \- runs the dracut hooks after /sysroot is mounted
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
dracut\-mount.service
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
This service runs all dracut hooks after the real root is mounted on /sysroot.
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.sp
Harald Hoyer
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
